+
+## Run the complete example
+
+```csharp
+using System;
+Console.WriteLine(10 / 4);
+Console.WriteLine((double)(10 / 4) == 2);
+Console.WriteLine((double)10 / 4 == 2.5);
+Console.WriteLine(10m / 4 == 2.5m);
+```
+
+```output
+2
+True
+True
+True
+```
