+
+## Run the complete example
+
+```csharp
+using System;
+Console.WriteLine(Department("  hr  "));
+Console.WriteLine(Department("   "));
+string Department(string raw)
+{
+    string cleaned = raw.Trim().ToUpperInvariant();
+    return cleaned.Length == 0 ? "Unknown" : cleaned;
+}
+```
+
+```output
+HR
+Unknown
+```
