+
+## Run the complete example
+
+```csharp
+using System;
+try
+{
+    int value = int.Parse("two");
+    Console.WriteLine(value);
+}
+catch (FormatException) { Console.WriteLine("Enter a whole number."); }
+finally { Console.WriteLine("Attempt complete."); }
+```
+
+```output
+Enter a whole number.
+Attempt complete.
+```
