+| Quantity visited | Running total | Saved order total |
+| ---: | ---: | --- |
+| 2 | 2 | Not saved yet |
+| 1 | 3 | Not saved yet |
+| 3 | 6 | Not saved yet |
+| Store ORD-101 | 6 | ORD-101 → 6 |
